                <pb facs="0759" n="615" sameAs="frus:frus1929v02/pg615"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.933/159: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-11-02T15:00:00-05:00">November 2, 1929—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>359. Referring to the last sentence in paragraph 3, my 354, October 28, 7 p.m.
                    Please immediately reply as to what action has been or is being taken.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
